# Abyssal Warden .gitignore
#
# Security-sensitive project: keep secrets, live malware, quarantine data and
# scan output out of the repository. If a file is ignored by mistake, review
# it before forcing it in with `git add -f`.
#
# Must stay tracked (do not ignore): Cargo.lock, .cargo/audit.toml,
# examples/keys/*.pub, *.minisig, examples/**.

# --- Build output -----------------------------------------------------------
/target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# --- Fuzzing ----------------------------------------------------------------
/fuzz/target/
/fuzz/corpus/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/coverage/

# --- Coverage / profiling ---------------------------------------------------
*.profraw
*.profdata
lcov.info
tarpaulin-report.*
/coverage/
perf.data*
flamegraph.svg

# --- Secrets and credentials ------------------------------------------------
# Signing keys: public keys (*.pub) and signatures (*.minisig) are fine to
# commit; secret keys never are.
*.key
*.sec
*.secret
minisign.key
.minisign/
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
!*.pub
.env
.env.*
*.token
.cargo/credentials
.cargo/credentials.toml
.netrc
secrets/

# --- Live malware and real-world samples ------------------------------------
# Tests use synthetic fixtures only (docs/development/contributing.md).
/samples/
**/malware/
**/malware-samples/
*.malware
*.infected
*.virus
*.vir
*.quarantine
# Password-protected sample archives conventionally use these names.
*infected*.zip
*infected*.7z
# Native executables and drivers have no place in this source repository.
*.exe
*.dll
*.sys
*.scr
*.msi
*.com
*.ocx
*.cpl

# --- Scanner runtime data ---------------------------------------------------
# Quarantine stores, audit logs and scan reports can contain live malware
# (encoded), paths and hashes from a real machine.
**/quarantine/
**/quarantine-store/
audit.log
/reports/
*.report.json
report.json

# --- Editors and OS ---------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.#*
\#*\#
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Local tool settings ----------------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
